# ai-studio

AI Studio is a lightweight, professional desktop app for local AI image and video generation. It is designed to work on a wide range of devices, with sensible defaults for low-resource computers and optional advanced settings for stronger hardware.

## Goals

- Free and local-first generation workflow
- Professional dark UI for image and video studios
- ComfyUI-friendly architecture for real local models
- Fast project management and generation queue
- Honest hardware checks and resource safety warnings
- Windows-first setup with clear Linux/macOS roadmap

## Included in this milestone

- Modern desktop shell structure for Tauri + React
- Professional dark interface for dashboard, image studio, and video studio
- Local project and generation database design
- Hardware detection utilities for CPU, RAM, GPU, and storage
- Python backend skeleton and API endpoints
- Windows installation instructions
- Automated tests for core compatibility logic

