## Quick start

### Frontend

```bash
cd apps/desktop
npm install
npm run dev
```

### Backend

```bash
cd services/backend
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
```

## Current status

This milestone is intentionally lightweight and production-safe:

- The UI is functional and polished
- The backend provides resource and project APIs
- Real model installation and actual AI generation will be added incrementally
- The app clearly separates planned engine integrations from implemented features

